      "review_summary": "This PR adds a Control UI helper to shorten long direct-chat session keys in the Sessions table/details, adds display tests, and still carries stale Gateway protocol doc hunks in the GitHub diff.\n\nPR surface: Source +25, Tests +159, Docs +4. Total +188 across 5 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. source-level. Current routing emits account-scoped and per-peer direct session keys, while the PR helper only matches the per-channel direct form, so those rows still fall back to long raw identifiers.",
